	(text_box "ESP32-S3-MINI-1x\n\n*In module variants that have embedded OSPI PSRAM, i.e., that embed ESP32-S3R8, pins I035, I036 and I037 are connected to the\nOSPI PSRAM and are not available for other uses.\n\nNote:\nESP32-S3 has four strapping pins: GPI00, GPI03, GPI045 and GPI046.\n\nGPIO0, GPI045 and GPI046 are connected to the chip's internal weak pull-up/pull-down during the chip reset.\n\nGPIO3 is floating by default."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 148.59 91.44 0)
		(size 48.26 36.83)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
